♪ I'd like to recall ♪

1128
00:59:14.790 --> 00:59:17.870
♪ Some of their names ♪

1129
00:59:18.370 --> 00:59:21.710
♪ Like Larry and Steve ♪

1130
00:59:22.290 --> 00:59:25.840
♪ Yeah. I'm makin' memories ♪

1131
00:59:26.300 --> 00:59:29.430
♪ That I can keep ♪

1132
00:59:30.220 --> 00:59:33.890
♪ Tonight I'm makin' memories ♪

1133
00:59:33.890 --> 00:59:37.520
♪ I'd like to remember ♪

1134
00:59:37.980 --> 00:59:41.020
♪ I'm meetin' new people ♪

1135
00:59:41.310 --> 00:59:44.980
♪ I'd like to recall ♪

1136
00:59:45.990 --> 00:59:49.400
♪ I'm makin' memories ♪

1137
00:59:49.410 --> 00:59:52.870
♪ I'd like to keep ♪

1138
00:59:52.870 --> 00:59:56.490
♪ Yeah. I'm makin' memories ♪

1139
00:59:56.500 --> 00:59:57.580
♪ I'd sure like to keep ♪

1140
00:59:57.580 --> 00:59:58.660
Captain...

1141
00:59:58.660 --> 01:00:00.750
incoming message from Starfleet Command.

1142
01:00:00.750 --> 01:00:02.380
Captain Batel is beaming onboard.

1143
01:00:02.380 --> 01:00:04.130
They want you and Commander Chin-Riley...

1144
01:00:04.130 --> 01:00:05.880
to meet her in the Transporter Room.

1145
01:00:13.760 --> 01:00:15.010
Captain Batel.

1146
01:00:15.470 --> 01:00:17.310
I didn't think we'd be seeing each other so soon.

1147
01:00:17.310 --> 01:00:18.480
I know. Captain.

1148
01:00:19.020 --> 01:00:20.810
And for the record. I'm sorry about this.

1149
01:00:28.400 --> 01:00:29.900
What the hell is going on?

1150
01:00:30.950 --> 01:00:34.030
Under Starfleet code of conduct 587.63...

1151
01:00:34.620 --> 01:00:37.040
I'm arresting Commander Una Chin-Riley for violations...

1152
01:00:37.040 --> 01:00:38.830
of our anti-genetic modification directive.

1153
01:00:41.040 --> 01:00:42.170
She's an Illyrian. Chris.

1154
01:00:42.170 --> 01:00:43.790
I don't care what she is.

1155
01:00:43.790 --> 01:00:45.080
She's my...
- I don't like it either...

1156
01:00:45.090 --> 01:00:46.380
but I have orders.

1157
01:00:47.500 --> 01:00:49.460
[GUARD GRUNTS]
- Captain.

1158
01:00:49.470 --> 01:00:50.510
Don't.

1159
01:00:50.880 --> 01:00:53.140
I've known this might happen for years.

1160
01:00:58.470 --> 01:01:00.060
I didn't ask for this job.

1161
01:01:00.680 --> 01:01:01.980
I really am sorry.

1162
01:01:03.230 --> 01:01:04.400
So am I.

1163
01:01:10.150 --> 01:01:11.530
Because this isn't over.

1164
01:01:13.950 --> 01:01:15.160
BATEL: Energize.

1165
